The formalization and new verification utilities in this package are provided
under Apache-2.0. No unconfirmed recipient identity is asserted.

The declaration-replay algorithm in tools/Recheck.lean is adapted from
Lean 4.19.0, Lean/Replay.lean, copyright (c) 2023 Kim Morrison, Apache-2.0.
The original copyright and attribution are retained in that file.
The adaptation calls the same Lean kernel directly to avoid asynchronous
elaborator-name collisions; it is not an independent kernel implementation.

Lean and Mathlib are dependencies, not included binaries in this package.
